      "content": "<!--\n  Plan Picker — three credit-based tiers.\n  The middle tier is the highlighted one: dark shell, inverted card and an\n  amber call to action. Model lists sit indented under their feature row.\n-->\n<section class=\"w-full bg-white py-20 dark:bg-neutral-950\">\n  <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6\">\n    <div class=\"mb-14 text-center\">\n      <h2 class=\"mb-4 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#1a1a1a] md:text-[40px] dark:text-gray-100\">\n        Choose your plan\n      </h2>\n      <p class=\"text-lg font-normal text-gray-600 md:text-xl\">\n        Scale creativity with higher limits, priority access, and early features\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 items-stretch gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\">\n      <!-- Starter -->\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col rounded-[32px] border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-neutral-900\">\n        <h3 class=\"mb-4 text-[22px] font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">Starter</h3>\n        <div class=\"mb-6 flex items-baseline\">\n          <span class=\"text-[54px] font-extrabold leading-none tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">$20</span>\n          <span class=\"ml-1 font-medium text-gray-600\">/mo</span>\n        </div>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"mb-6 w-full rounded-full bg-[#2d2d2d] py-3.5 font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-black dark:bg-white dark:text-neutral-900 dark:hover:bg-gray-200\">\n          Upgrade Plan\n        </button>\n\n        <div class=\"relative mb-8 rounded-[20px] bg-[#f4f4f5] p-5 dark:bg-white/5\">\n          <div class=\"absolute right-4 top-4 text-gray-300 dark:text-muted-foreground\">\n            <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n              <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" />\n              <path d=\"M14 15.523A4.5 4.5 0 1 1 14 8.477\" />\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mb-1 text-[15px] font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">1,200 <span class=\"font-normal\">©</span>/mo</div>\n          <div class=\"mb-1 text-xs text-gray-600\">$1.67 / 100 ©</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-600\">\n            Generate up to 600 images or 18 videos every month.\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <ul class=\"flex-grow space-y-4 text-[14.5px] text-[#333] dark:text-muted-foreground\">\n          <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200\">✓</span><span>Watermark-free exports</span></li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200\">✓</span><span>FacePass</span></li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200\">✓</span><span>Image Models</span></li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200\">✓</span><span>Video Models</span></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Standard -->\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col rounded-[32px] border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-neutral-900\">\n        <h3 class=\"mb-4 text-[22px] font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">Standard</h3>\n        <div class=\"mb-6 flex items-baseline\">\n          <span class=\"text-[54px] font-extrabold leading-none tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">$60</span>\n          <span class=\"ml-1 font-medium text-gray-600\">/mo</span>\n        </div>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"mb-6 w-full rounded-full bg-[#2d2d2d] py-3.5 font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-black dark:bg-white dark:text-neutral-900 dark:hover:bg-gray-200\">\n          Upgrade Plan\n        </button>\n\n        <div class=\"relative mb-8 rounded-[20px] bg-[#f4f4f5] p-5 dark:bg-white/5\">\n          <div class=\"absolute right-4 top-4 text-gray-300 dark:text-muted-foreground\">\n            <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n              <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" />\n              <path d=\"M14 15.523A4.5 4.5 0 1 1 14 8.477\" />\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mb-1 text-[15px] font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">3,600 <span class=\"font-normal\">©</span>/mo</div>\n          <div class=\"mb-1 text-xs text-gray-600\">$1.67 / 100 ©</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-600\">\n            Generate up to 1,800 images or 56 videos every month.\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <ul class=\"flex-grow space-y-4 text-[14.5px] text-[#333] dark:text-muted-foreground\">\n          <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200\">✓</span><span>Watermark-free exports</span></li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200\">✓</span><span>FacePass</span></li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200\">✓</span><span>Latest Image Models</span></li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200\">✓</span><span>Priority queue</span></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Pro — highlighted -->\n      <div class=\"rounded-[32px] bg-[#2d2d2d] p-2 shadow-sm dark:bg-black\">\n        <div class=\"mb-1 flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3\">\n          <span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#fcd34d]\">Most popular</span>\n          <span class=\"rounded-full bg-white/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-white\">Save 14%</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex h-[calc(100%-3.25rem)] flex-col rounded-[26px] bg-white p-8 dark:bg-neutral-900\">\n          <h3 class=\"mb-4 text-[22px] font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">Pro</h3>\n          <div class=\"mb-6 flex items-baseline\">\n            <span class=\"text-[54px] font-extrabold leading-none tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">$200</span>\n            <span class=\"ml-1 font-medium text-gray-600\">/mo</span>\n          </div>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"mb-6 w-full rounded-full bg-[#fcd34d] py-3.5 font-semibold text-[#2d2d2d] transition-colors hover:bg-[#f5c531]\">\n            Upgrade Plan\n          </button>\n\n          <div class=\"relative mb-8 rounded-[20px] bg-[#f4f4f5] p-5 dark:bg-white/5\">\n            <div class=\"absolute right-4 top-4 text-gray-300 dark:text-muted-foreground\">\n              <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" />\n                <path d=\"M14 15.523A4.5 4.5 0 1 1 14 8.477\" />\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mb-1 text-[15px] font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">14,000 <span class=\"font-normal\">©</span>/mo</div>\n            <div class=\"mb-1 text-xs text-gray-600\">$1.43 / 100 ©</div>\n            <div class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-600\">\n              Generate up to 7,000 images or 218 videos every month.\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <ul class=\"flex-grow space-y-4 text-[14.5px] text-[#333] dark:text-muted-foreground\">\n            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200\">✓</span><span>Watermark-free exports</span></li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200\">✓</span><span>FacePass</span></li>\n            <li>\n              <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200\">✓</span><span>Latest Image Models</span></div>\n              <div class=\"ml-[26px] mt-2 flex flex-col gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-gray-600\">\n                <span>Nano Banana 2</span>\n                <span>Nano Banana Pro</span>\n                <span>Midjourney V7</span>\n                <span>GPT Image 2</span>\n              </div>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <div class=\"mt-4 flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200\">✓</span><span>Latest Video Models</span></div>\n              <div class=\"ml-[26px] mt-2 flex flex-col gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-gray-600\">\n                <span>Seedance 2.0</span>\n                <span>HappyHorse 1.0</span>\n              </div>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n"
    }
